WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:05,410
If you hadn't had the medicine last time

2
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:06,410
I might not be able to bear it

3
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:08,410
So don’t show off despite being caught in the rain in the future.

4
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:09,410
You are quite gentle to him

5
00:00:09,410 --> 00:00:11,410
I'm not bad at treating valuable people

6
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,410
What about me?

7
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:13,410
You have asked this for the third time today

8
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:16,680
where did you come from

9
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,680
none of your business

10
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:22,310
Someone must tell Su Che about our situation

11
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:24,310
Otherwise, how could he prepare such a thing?

12
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,310
Maybe Xu Rouer

13
00:00:26,310 --> 00:00:27,540
It must be Su Tang

14
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,540
He keeps running in both directions lately

15
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:32,340
Every time something happens to you, you blame the country on me.

16
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,340
It's because I usually don't worry

17
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:36,560
It’s not because I’ve really done everything and still pretend.

18
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,560
How much benefit did you take from me before?

19
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:41,560
Now sell me Su Che behind my back

20
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,560
What's wrong with taking care of some things for Sister Xueya?

21
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,560
The most tiring job before

22
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:47,650
I didn't let you do it either

23
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:49,650
I was not asked to do the most tiring work in the past.

24
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,650
So I deserve to be blamed for you.

25
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:52,650
Then give me that little bit of preferential treatment

26
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:54,650
It turns out you bought my face in advance.
